## Import

Import is supported using `organization_id/project_id/group_id`. All three are
required: the project and group ids are only meaningful within their
organization, and the organization is part of the API route.

```shell
terraform import circleci_project_group.security "<organization_id>/<project_id>/<group_id>"
```
